    "AGENTS.md": "# Team notes\n\nRun the linter before pushing.\n\n<!-- surveyjs:start -->\n## SurveyJS\n\nInstalled in this project: `survey-pdf@3.0.1`. Also declared: `survey-core@^3.0.1`, `survey-vue3-ui@^3.0.1` — these are the ranges from `package.json`. No lockfile or `node_modules` was readable, so the exact installed version could not be verified; treat the range as a lower bound and check the installed package if a documented API is missing. UI framework: **vue3**.\n\nThe SurveyJS agent skills are installed in `.agents/skills`. Read the skill that matches the task before writing or changing SurveyJS code — they carry the current v3 API and the mistakes to check generated code against:\n\n- [`surveyjs-brand-styling`](.agents/skills/surveyjs-brand-styling/SKILL.md) — Style a SurveyJS application so it matches a custom app design, design system, or brandbook\n- [`surveyjs-form-json`](.agents/skills/surveyjs-form-json/SKILL.md) — Author, edit, or debug SurveyJS survey/form JSON\n- [`surveyjs-integration`](.agents/skills/surveyjs-integration/SKILL.md) — Integrate the SurveyJS Form Library into React, Next.js, Angular, Vue, vanilla JS, or jQuery apps\n- [`surveyjs-pdf-generator`](.agents/skills/surveyjs-pdf-generator/SKILL.md) — Generate PDF documents from SurveyJS forms with SurveyJS PDF Generator (the survey-pdf package)\n\nEverything between the `surveyjs:start` and `surveyjs:end` markers is regenerated by `surveyjs-cli 0.1.0` (`npx surveyjs-cli@latest init-agents`). Put your own notes outside the markers.\n<!-- surveyjs:end -->\n"
